<title>UK: BayerHypo sets 150 mln mark step-up callable bond.</title>
<headline>BayerHypo sets 150 mln mark step-up callable bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Bayerische Hypothekenbank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BAYERISCHE HYPOTHEKENBANK</p>
<p> AMT    150 MLN DEM   COUPON     *3.75     MATURITY  **10.MAR.99</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.05    PAY DATE    10.SEP.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  UNDISC    LISTING    MUNICH    DENOMS (M) ONE</p>
<p> NOTES	*UNTIL CALL THEN STEPS UP TO 4.625 PCT THEREAFTER</p>
<p>	     **CALL AFTER SIX MONTHS AT PAR</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
